<title>USA: Dimon Inc Q3 $0.44 vs $0.16.</title>
<headline>Dimon Inc Q3 $0.44 vs $0.16.</headline>
<dateline>DANVILLE, Va. 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Net shr	   $0.44		    $0.16</p>
<p> Net		 18.8		     6.3</p>
<p>sales&amp;other oper</p>
<p>    rev	    668.1		    577.1</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  n/a			n/a</p>
<p>	   9  MONTHSended March 31</p>
<p> Net shr	   $1.20		    $0.83</p>
<p> Net		 51.1		     32.1</p>
<p>Sales&amp;other oper</p>
<p>    rev	    1,850.2		  1680.2</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  n/a			n/a</p>
<p>(All data above in millions in except per share numbers) The company's net income in last year's quarter is after restructuring charges of $2.8 million relating to the post-merger consolidation of its operations.</p>
<p>The company's fully diluted earnings per share for the nine-month period of 1997 was 1.19 per share.</p>
<p>The previous year's nine- month period net income is after restructuring charges and extraordinary items.</p>
<p>That period's fully diluted earnings per share were $0.80.</p>
<p>The company said its results for the quarter and nine- month period do not include the financial results for Intabex Holdings Worldwide Inc and the related interests that were acquired on April 1.</p>
<p>Intabex's results for the quarter ending June 30 will be included in DIMON's consolidated operations at June 30.</p>
